@startuml 04-物流货运端
' 民生甄选 · 系统用例图 L2 · 物流货运端（UC-SYS-L01 ~ L05）
' 网约车/出租车明确不做
title 民生甄选 · 系统用例图 · 物流货运端
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "货主" as SHIPPER
actor "货运司机" as DRIVER

rectangle "物流货运端系统（功能边界）" {
  usecase "UC-SYS-L01 发布货源与自由接单" as L01
  usecase "UC-SYS-L02 查看在途位置并存证轨迹" as L02
  usecase "UC-SYS-L03 核验司机资质与信用" as L03
  usecase "UC-SYS-L04 托管并结算运费" as L04
  usecase "UC-SYS-L05 公示货运费率" as L05
}

SHIPPER --> L01
SHIPPER --> L02
SHIPPER --> L04
SHIPPER --> L05
DRIVER --> L01
DRIVER --> L02
DRIVER --> L03
DRIVER --> L04
DRIVER --> L05

note bottom of L04
  运费结算 include 代付结算（UC-SUB-I-03），共用结算体系
end note
@enduml
